# Unreal build and derived data. None of this belongs in git — it is all
# regenerated from Source/ and Config/ on the next build.
Binaries/
Build/
DerivedDataCache/
Intermediate/
Saved/
.vs/
.vscode/
*.sln
*.suo
*.xcodeproj/
*.xcworkspace/

# Content/ is deliberately NOT ignored, but note that .uasset and .umap are
# binary: they can be committed, they just cannot be diffed or merged.
